{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dream Slayers: Pet's and Pals DLC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support the continued development of <strong>Dream Slayers</strong> and embark on your journey with loyal companions by your side!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each pet not only follows you into battle but adds life and character to your adventures across the Dream Realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each pet features a minimum of 5 unique variations and two can be equipped at anytime.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Current Pet Companions Included:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dog / Wolf\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crocodile\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiger\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toad\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turtle\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bat\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Future Pets (Free Additions for Owners of this Pack):</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eagle\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hermit Crab\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raptor\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snail\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spider\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wisp\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus More!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Whether you prefer fierce predators or mystical creatures, your allies await in the Dream Realm. Thank you for supporting the growth of Dream Slayers!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4137900?t=1762476545","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/413